./docs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:13377:      "no_figure_rationale": "The current crop from Extended Data Fig. 1 is invalid because it depicts evaluator/scorer prompts, not target-model input. No alternative candidate is clearly better for the listed route. Figure 1 is a high-level training workflow, not the evaluation prompt interface. Figure 6 does show prompts going into an LMM, but they are different multimodal example tasks and do not match the listed text-only gene-function-description evaluation route. The other figures are embeddings, results, ablations, or decorative icons without an input path. Under the atlas rules, this leaves no defensible figure for the recorded route.",
./docs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:13472:      "no_figure_rationale": "The current crop only shows a high-level Geneverse preprocessing/training workflow. It does not visibly show the evaluation-time gene-function prompt, retrieved supporting documents, or the combined text input presented to Gemma-7B (RAG). No other visible candidate figure shows that immediate model-facing RAG text input either; the LLM-RAG figure is performance-only. Therefore no source figure visibly supports this actual model input route.",
