./data/living_catalog/taxonomy_rerun_preflight_2026-08-12/taxonomy/runs/classification_dense/shard_06/records/update_2026-08-09__rec_000138_796e32b2faec/update_2026_08_09_rec_000138_796e32b2faec_docling_json_20260812_205735/docling/document.dclg:4850:    these four tasks demonstrate that multi-task language-model training produces a representation 1 that extends beyond cell-type identity and perturbation response into cross-species, cross2 developmental-stage, and gene-functional reasoning. Concurrent work such as CeLLM (Li et al., 3 2024), ST-LLM (Wang et al., 2024), and AlphaCell (2025) has begun exploring adjacent 4 directions; the present contribution is the breadth of tasks unified in a single fine-tuning run 5 rather than the paradigm itself. 6
./data/living_catalog/taxonomy_rerun_preflight_2026-08-12/taxonomy/runs/classification_dense/shard_06/records/update_2026-08-09__rec_000138_796e32b2faec/update_2026_08_09_rec_000138_796e32b2faec_docling_json_20260812_205735/docling/document.dclg:4857:    OCellus-Agent 7
./data/living_catalog/taxonomy_rerun_preflight_2026-08-12/taxonomy/runs/classification_dense/shard_06/records/update_2026-08-09__rec_000138_796e32b2faec/update_2026_08_09_rec_000138_796e32b2faec_docling_json_20260812_205735/docling/document.dclg:4864:    Making the full capability suite accessible without writing custom code per task requires an 8 agent layer that translates natural-language queries into executable pipelines. OCellus-Agent 9 provides this through three architectural layers over the same Qwen3.5-9B backbone (Figure 8): 10 a Coordinator containing a trained Planner LoRA, a rule-based Router, and a three-layer Verifier 11 with a trained Critic LoRA; five expert roles (Data Loader, Annotator, Perturbation, Spatial, 12 Explainer) implemented as dynamic LoRA swaps on the shared backbone; and a Tool Registry 13 of fifteen registered tools exposed via a Gradio web interface. Six interchangeable runtime 14 configurations are loaded on demand through dynamic adapter swapping, so the entire agent 15 occupies approximately twenty-two gigabytes of GPU memory on a single GPU rather than five 16 separate model instances. 17
./data/living_catalog/taxonomy_rerun_preflight_2026-08-12/taxonomy/runs/classification_dense/shard_06/records/update_2026-08-09__rec_000138_796e32b2faec/update_2026_08_09_rec_000138_796e32b2faec_docling_json_20260812_205735/docling/document.dclg:4898:The image contains two labeled panels, `a` and `b`, describing an “OCellus-Agent” system and an ablation-style performance result.
